  "title": "Accounting Software 2026: Free Plans and Price Increases",
  "meta_description": "QuickBooks Free connects one bank account. QuickBooks, Xero, FreshBooks raised prices in 2026. Zoho Books and Wave did not.",
  "lead": "QuickBooks Free connects one bank account; Zoho Books Free and Wave Starter do not. QuickBooks Online raised prices from August 1 renewals, Xero on October 1, and FreshBooks from January 27. Zoho Books and Wave did not change plan prices in 2026.",
